Author: lora-dataset-studio <noreply@lora-dataset-studio.dev>
Date:   Mon Aug 24 12:12:41 2026 +0200

    feat(gallery): selection delete and ZIP for the app-wide feed
    
    Delete is the checkpoint delete with its scope removed — same recoverable
    disposal, same refusals (a generating cell is skipped, never cancelled);
    the narrow routes keep their 'not ours to delete' guard, pinned by a test.
    
    The ZIP is selection-ONLY: the feed spans every run, so an absent ids
    argument is refused rather than widened into an accidental everything.
    Archive names keep the lineage grammar; a cross-dataset pick drops the
    dataset slug it cannot honestly carry.
